WEBVTT

01:12.971 --> 01:18.970
[Meet Yourself]

01:18.970 --> 01:24.943
[Episode 07]

01:38.663 --> 01:40.755
- Cut the string.
- Okay.

01:47.423 --> 01:49.899
This can be a little longer.

01:51.813 --> 01:54.217
Master, Master Xie is here.

01:55.223 --> 01:56.503
Heshun.

01:57.173 --> 01:59.023
- Sis.
- Come on.

01:59.023 --> 02:00.453
Li Qing, make a pot of tea.

02:00.453 --> 02:02.703
- No. Don't bother.
- Come on.

02:02.703 --> 02:04.583
I just dropped by. I'm leaving now.

02:04.583 --> 02:06.263
Just sit down for a while.

02:06.263 --> 02:06.894
Here.

02:06.894 --> 02:09.053
Look. I'm causing you extra work.

02:09.053 --> 02:10.423
Not at all. Here, sit.

02:10.423 --> 02:11.703
Okay.

02:18.041 --> 02:19.863
Our embroidery workshop was completed
for so long.

02:19.863 --> 02:21.703
You didn't come to see it.

02:22.173 --> 02:23.593
It's not on my way.

02:23.823 --> 02:25.023
Master Xie, you're just in time.

02:25.023 --> 02:27.823
We just returned from Xinjiang last night.

02:27.933 --> 02:29.453
Why did you go to Xinjiang?

02:29.453 --> 02:31.373
For an intangible cultural heritage exhibition.

02:31.373 --> 02:32.997
What's it?

02:33.333 --> 02:35.333
It's just an exhibition.

02:35.333 --> 02:38.743
An Expo for various intangible cultural
heritage handicrafts around the country.

02:38.743 --> 02:39.743
A big event.

02:39.743 --> 02:41.053
A lot of people went to see it.

02:41.053 --> 02:43.169
We sold many things there.

02:43.373 --> 02:47.253
- You can sell things on it?
- Of course. There are stalls.

02:48.213 --> 02:50.429
Here, have some tea.

02:50.453 --> 02:51.733
Okay.

02:52.423 --> 02:57.298
Gezi is responsible for various
exhibitions of embroideries and tie-dyes

02:57.298 --> 02:59.613
and the promotion of brick and mortar stores.

02:59.613 --> 03:03.103
Xiaolan looks after the day-to-day
running of the craft online store.

03:03.103 --> 03:06.613
We craftsmen just make sure we do ours.

03:06.613 --> 03:10.183
Different people are
specialized for particular tasks.

03:12.333 --> 03:17.173
Sis, how big do you want it to be?

03:17.173 --> 03:19.213
The bigger the better, of course.

03:19.213 --> 03:21.493
It's not the same as before.

03:21.493 --> 03:23.333
The world is moving on so fast.

03:23.333 --> 03:27.461
If no one knows our stuff, we'll be obsoleted.

03:27.470 --> 03:30.373
Why should the state protect
the intangible cultural heritage?

03:30.373 --> 03:33.893
It fears these folk skills would go away.

03:33.893 --> 03:36.173
So, we need to promote them.

03:36.173 --> 03:40.909
Let the younger generation
understand these cultures and like them.

03:40.933 --> 03:43.303
In this case, some people
are willing to learn them

03:43.303 --> 03:44.670
and some pay for them.

03:44.670 --> 03:46.754
Only then can we pass them on.

03:50.893 --> 03:54.143
In the past, when masters
passed on their crafts to apprentices,

03:54.143 --> 03:55.893
they had discharged their duty.

03:55.893 --> 04:01.501
Now, they have to find a way to feed the kids.

04:31.663 --> 04:33.431
Morning, Little Hei.

06:35.493 --> 06:37.693
Breakfast is ready. Want to eat?

06:44.343 --> 06:45.623
Go.

06:45.863 --> 06:47.143
Come on.

06:51.013 --> 06:53.417
Mr. Ma, want to eat with us?

07:05.173 --> 07:06.783
I want some soup.

07:06.783 --> 07:09.319
It's delicious with a little soup.

07:10.223 --> 07:12.327
This is shredded potatoes with vinegar.

07:12.327 --> 07:14.173
Why did you put dark soy sauce in it?

07:14.173 --> 07:16.193
It's the way my mom makes it.

07:17.303 --> 07:18.903
Moms are always right.

07:20.693 --> 07:21.423
Good.

07:21.423 --> 07:21.864
Delicious?

07:21.864 --> 07:22.783
This is it.

07:22.783 --> 07:24.253
This taste is right.

07:24.253 --> 07:25.733
I'll have some more.

07:39.223 --> 07:40.847
Nice. Delicious.

07:53.423 --> 07:54.719
Zhiyao.

07:54.955 --> 07:56.784
Let me introduce you, President Li.

07:56.784 --> 07:57.933
This is Xie Zhiyao.

07:57.933 --> 07:59.013
My good friend.

07:59.013 --> 08:00.543
President Li, nice to meet you.

08:00.543 --> 08:01.903
Hello, President Xie.

08:01.903 --> 08:04.343
- How did you get here?
- I drove here.

08:04.343 --> 08:06.387
You can't drink, then?

08:06.784 --> 08:08.783
Yes. I got my driver with me.

08:08.783 --> 08:10.053
You came prepared.

08:10.053 --> 08:11.303
Good.

08:11.303 --> 08:12.543
Come on, sit.

08:12.543 --> 08:14.103
Here, please, President Xie.

08:14.103 --> 08:14.743
Take a seat.

08:14.743 --> 08:16.023
Here, Li.

08:23.693 --> 08:24.973
President Xie.

08:26.063 --> 08:27.743
It's not that your stuff is bad.

08:27.743 --> 08:29.641
I know it's good.

08:29.641 --> 08:31.355
But it's expensive.

08:31.355 --> 08:34.703
Put machine carvings of
a couple hundred yuan on the walls.

08:34.703 --> 08:38.919
Normal people don't even tell the difference.

08:39.133 --> 08:41.343
I'm in the high-end art hotel business.

08:41.343 --> 08:47.227
I'd rather save the money
and update our bedding.

08:49.743 --> 08:53.287
President Li, you're honest.

08:53.343 --> 08:56.643
You're frank with me,
then I'll be honest with you, too.

08:56.653 --> 08:59.893
I'm here to make this deal with you, of course.

08:59.893 --> 09:02.969
But I was really thinking about your hotel.

09:03.413 --> 09:04.943
You're making a Chinese brand.

09:04.943 --> 09:08.223
You want to use traditional culture
as a feature of your art hotel.

09:08.223 --> 09:10.723
Then you should use hand-carved ones.

09:12.413 --> 09:13.893
How do you say that?

09:14.823 --> 09:17.253
He knew I was an investor.

09:17.253 --> 09:19.629
I listened to stories every day.

09:19.653 --> 09:22.613
A good entrepreneur must be a storyteller first.

09:22.613 --> 09:24.373
The more compelling your story is,

09:24.373 --> 09:27.229
the more people are willing to pay for it.

09:27.253 --> 09:28.877
Look at your hotel.

09:29.103 --> 09:32.107
China-Chic, traditional culture,

09:32.133 --> 09:34.670
high quality, it's got all these.

09:34.670 --> 09:37.390
The one thing it lacks is a good story.

09:38.823 --> 09:40.103
Go ahead.

09:40.583 --> 09:43.011
Let me tell you a story first.

09:43.823 --> 09:47.103
A young man grew up
in a fishing village near the sea.

09:47.103 --> 09:49.241
He was a left-behind child since he was a kid.

09:49.241 --> 09:50.863
Later, he got into a university in Beijing.

09:50.863 --> 09:52.773
And he had a good job.

09:52.773 --> 09:56.155
But he resolutely returned home
and started a business.

09:56.155 --> 09:58.583
He opened an online store
to sell their agricultural products.

09:58.583 --> 10:00.213
He hired the villagers.

10:00.213 --> 10:03.013
He helped an inheritor
of embroidery set up a workshop.

10:03.013 --> 10:06.413
He invested in tie-dye workshops
and protected traditional art.

10:06.413 --> 10:08.103
He also developed tourism.

10:08.103 --> 10:11.413
He made more young people choose
to stay instead of going out to work.

10:11.413 --> 10:14.063
So, kids are no longer left-behind children.

10:14.063 --> 10:17.163
Senior people are no longer empty nesters.

10:18.133 --> 10:20.613
Why does it sound so familiar?

10:20.613 --> 10:22.760
I think I've seen it on TV.

10:22.784 --> 10:24.773
It's a classic story often told by a man

10:24.773 --> 10:26.253
who returned home to start a business.

10:26.253 --> 10:29.593
If there are any similarities,
they're similarities.

10:30.983 --> 10:35.151
This classic story is of no use to me.

10:35.653 --> 10:37.013
You need it.

10:37.013 --> 10:39.465
There's a plot you can learn from.

10:39.773 --> 10:41.053
Tell me.

10:41.773 --> 10:44.653
A boss likes traditional culture very much.

10:44.653 --> 10:47.463
He thinks Chinese traditional art
should be kept thriving,

10:47.463 --> 10:49.063
should be seen by more people.

10:49.063 --> 10:51.253
So, he set up an art hotel that's filled with

10:51.253 --> 10:54.373
all traditional intangible
cultural heritage artworks.

10:54.373 --> 10:57.613
Even a decorative woodcarving
painting in the corridor,

10:57.613 --> 11:01.889
was carved by skilled masters very seriously.

11:01.943 --> 11:06.319
Here's the detail of the story.

11:06.343 --> 11:09.253
Right. This is Li's story.

11:09.253 --> 11:09.824
Yeah.

11:09.824 --> 11:12.503
He loves Chinese traditional culture.

11:12.613 --> 11:13.893
Right.

11:14.670 --> 11:16.047
That's me.

11:16.613 --> 11:18.360
Here, President Li.

11:18.384 --> 11:20.223
Don't call me that. We're brothers.

11:20.223 --> 11:20.654
Brothers.

11:20.654 --> 11:22.385
- Come on.
- Here.

11:26.103 --> 11:27.383
Easy.

11:33.103 --> 11:34.383
Liu.

11:34.653 --> 11:35.773
Thank you!

11:35.773 --> 11:37.653
For what? Get some sleep.

11:37.653 --> 11:40.013
Sir, watch out for him. Don't let him puke.

11:40.013 --> 11:40.613
Okay.

11:40.613 --> 11:41.063
Go.

11:41.063 --> 11:41.493
Okay.

11:41.493 --> 11:42.063
Bye.

11:42.063 --> 11:43.343
See you.

11:53.373 --> 11:54.653
Granny.

11:55.773 --> 11:57.061
You're back.

11:57.893 --> 12:00.237
I bought your favorite cured ribs.

12:07.293 --> 12:10.657
You still remember I like cured ribs.

12:14.773 --> 12:16.169
Did you drink?

12:16.823 --> 12:18.159
A few.

12:18.863 --> 12:20.523
How did it go?

12:21.063 --> 12:22.373
Not bad.

12:22.373 --> 12:23.757
I've got it.

12:24.373 --> 12:25.653
Really?

12:28.583 --> 12:31.983
Here. This is your reward.

12:35.293 --> 12:36.573
Sweet.

12:42.983 --> 12:44.263
Sweet.

12:57.223 --> 12:59.613
Yao and I have been friends since we were kids.

12:59.613 --> 13:01.861
He used to eat at my home.

13:02.463 --> 13:04.955
We went to middle school
together and lived at school.

13:04.955 --> 13:07.559
We still lived at school in high school.

13:07.583 --> 13:08.943
It was hard.

13:08.943 --> 13:10.183
I was not good at school.

13:10.183 --> 13:11.893
I didn't get into a college.

13:11.893 --> 13:14.653
Then, my family introduced a girl to me.

13:14.653 --> 13:16.241
When we met,

13:16.898 --> 13:19.638
it was the girl I liked in middle school.

13:19.823 --> 13:23.653
But she asked me for
Yao's number when she talked.

13:23.653 --> 13:25.241
Do you think it's outrageous?

13:25.241 --> 13:26.773
Did you give it to her?

13:26.773 --> 13:27.893
Yeah, I did.

13:27.893 --> 13:29.805
Or, it'd make me petty.

13:31.373 --> 13:34.384
Yao was busy studying and getting scholarships.

13:34.384 --> 13:36.555
He didn't have time to mess with girls.

13:36.555 --> 13:39.641
When he graduated from college, I
asked him if he'd come back home.

13:39.641 --> 13:42.458
He told me he got into graduate school.

13:42.893 --> 13:46.583
I asked him how big a boss
he'd be since he was overeducated.

13:46.583 --> 13:48.533
He's a boss.

13:48.533 --> 13:51.989
He's working in his own industry now.

13:52.013 --> 13:55.159
Yeah, he's a big boss.

13:55.183 --> 13:58.535
He invested a lot
all these years he's been here.

13:58.613 --> 14:00.103
But has he made any money?

14:00.103 --> 14:01.619
Not much indeed.

14:01.743 --> 14:04.533
He said it was the funding stage if I asked.

14:04.533 --> 14:05.983
I don't understand.

14:05.983 --> 14:08.841
If you ask me, that's worse than him working

14:08.841 --> 14:10.943
as an angel investor in Beijing for years.

14:10.943 --> 14:13.335
He got a high salary and a bonus.

14:13.493 --> 14:15.583
What are you talking about?

14:15.583 --> 14:16.955
You scared me.

14:16.955 --> 14:19.527
- What are you talking about?
- Just talking.

14:19.527 --> 14:21.755
About my barbecue and your college.

14:21.755 --> 14:23.253
What can I get you?

14:23.253 --> 14:24.985
I've already eaten.

14:26.893 --> 14:28.943
Make some vegetables for me, okay?

14:28.943 --> 14:29.584
Yeah.

14:29.584 --> 14:31.343
I'll take them to you when they're done.

14:31.343 --> 14:32.623
Okay.

14:50.653 --> 14:53.731
Don't bother. His phone is off.
[Little Yuan]

14:53.755 --> 14:55.881
You're more like his sister.

14:58.223 --> 15:00.423
I really want to explain to him.

15:01.533 --> 15:03.445
I didn't say that.

15:04.103 --> 15:06.963
Who do you think said it?

15:07.063 --> 15:09.107
I don't know.

15:09.653 --> 15:11.533
The walls in the village look pretty thick.

15:11.533 --> 15:12.773
But they leak on all sides.

15:12.773 --> 15:14.973
No point in keeping it a secret.

15:22.373 --> 15:25.223
I saw you staying in the cafe
for the last few days.

15:25.223 --> 15:26.613
You didn't hang out?

15:26.613 --> 15:27.773
Where?

15:27.773 --> 15:29.013
Tie-dye workshop.

15:29.013 --> 15:30.943
You can experience the dyeing.

15:30.943 --> 15:32.213
I did it in the afternoon.

15:32.213 --> 15:34.327
The woodcarving workshop next to the cafe.

15:34.327 --> 15:35.413
I bought something.

15:35.413 --> 15:36.373
The bamboo raft?

15:36.373 --> 15:37.293
I took it.

15:37.293 --> 15:39.589
Horseback riding. It's funny.

15:39.613 --> 15:41.653
- I won't go.
- Why?

15:41.653 --> 15:42.933
I don't like it.

15:44.103 --> 15:45.253
Oh, yeah.

15:45.253 --> 15:48.413
There's a large campground
on the east of the village.

15:48.413 --> 15:51.743
Picking, fishing, barbecuing and etc.

15:51.743 --> 15:53.763
My friend in Beijing runs it.

15:54.784 --> 15:56.539
He's losing his money?

15:57.253 --> 15:59.343
It's just not profitable yet.

15:59.343 --> 16:03.547
Take Damai and Nana there when you have time.

16:03.613 --> 16:04.893
Let me tell you.

16:04.893 --> 16:09.829
Don't try to promote
those artificial attractions.

16:10.223 --> 16:15.063
I'm here to find someplace
where nobody knows me.

16:15.063 --> 16:19.903
I want to be a useless loser seriously.

16:23.183 --> 16:26.919
When did you set such a great ideal?

16:27.863 --> 16:29.667
Before I worked,

16:29.983 --> 16:33.079
all I was doing was studying, studying.

16:33.103 --> 16:36.503
After I worked, it's been work, work.

16:37.183 --> 16:38.983
I've been trying and trying.

16:38.983 --> 16:42.239
I didn't like losing and falling behind.

16:42.533 --> 16:46.749
You know, I saved enough money

16:46.841 --> 16:49.933
to buy a few square meters when I graduated.

16:50.773 --> 16:52.829
Ten years have passed.

16:53.641 --> 16:55.704
I've saved some money.

16:55.983 --> 16:58.531
But I can only buy a few square meters

16:58.555 --> 17:01.175
when I checked the real estate website.

17:01.423 --> 17:06.455
No house, no car, no boyfriend,

17:07.623 --> 17:08.903
but illness.

17:11.743 --> 17:13.023
So miserable?

17:13.493 --> 17:15.663
Isn't there a saying on the Internet?

17:15.663 --> 17:16.898
What's it?

17:16.898 --> 17:18.383
You're not good at your job.

17:18.383 --> 17:19.463
Your performance is bad.

17:19.463 --> 17:20.983
But you have a herniated disc.

17:20.983 --> 17:22.463
It's like me.

17:22.573 --> 17:27.223
Look, my arch has gone.

17:27.223 --> 17:29.053
Look, I was on my feet all day.

17:29.053 --> 17:30.773
My arch has fallen.

17:33.293 --> 17:34.493
Laugh.

17:34.493 --> 17:36.493
No. If you have some empathy,

17:36.493 --> 17:39.383
you wouldn't laugh like that
when I'm talking about my pain.

17:39.383 --> 17:41.775
Your arch has fallen.

17:43.013 --> 17:45.281
It's not funny!

17:46.853 --> 17:48.333
I'm sorry!

17:48.743 --> 17:51.093
I... I'm not laughing at you!

17:51.093 --> 17:55.885
I mean, you're blessed if you
can make me laugh so happily.

17:58.013 --> 18:00.069
I just think,

18:00.093 --> 18:02.773
you can't tighten yourself up too much.

18:02.773 --> 18:04.623
Or, there will be problems.

18:04.623 --> 18:08.423
Like, misanthropy,
evasion, anxiety, irritability,

18:08.423 --> 18:11.043
all kinds of diseases will come to you.

18:11.293 --> 18:14.549
Is it my choice to tighten up or not?

18:15.333 --> 18:16.463
You're like the clock.

18:16.463 --> 18:19.573
Once you're winded up,
no one wants to replace you

18:19.573 --> 18:21.855
until you're useless.

18:24.493 --> 18:27.119
I think you're pretty good.

18:27.143 --> 18:28.813
Put on makeup and clean up.

18:28.813 --> 18:30.383
You're also a beauty.

18:30.383 --> 18:33.783
You have no problem getting a good man.

18:35.333 --> 18:36.813
I like a man for his money.

18:36.813 --> 18:38.463
He likes me for my looks.

18:38.463 --> 18:41.663
After a few more years, I'm still a beauty.

18:41.663 --> 18:43.659
Is he still rich?

18:45.527 --> 18:48.013
Do you see everything perfectly clearly?

18:48.013 --> 18:52.097
Only what you have is your own.

18:59.013 --> 19:00.293
Here's to you.

19:02.333 --> 19:04.389
No, that's not alcohol.

19:04.533 --> 19:06.505
I drank at noon.

19:06.663 --> 19:09.223
I'll be an alcoholic if I drink again.

19:26.213 --> 19:28.185
It was great as a kid.

19:31.127 --> 19:33.053
I always looked forward to the holidays.

19:33.053 --> 19:35.013
Then I'd go to my grandma's.

19:35.903 --> 19:37.563
Raising chicks,

19:38.093 --> 19:41.119
climbing up trees,
picking wild mulberries,

19:41.143 --> 19:43.223
catching shrimp in the stream.

19:44.498 --> 19:47.246
You were so naughty when you were little?

19:49.470 --> 19:52.178
Don't you think it was fun as a kid?

19:54.384 --> 19:58.639
When we grew up, all we had
to do were study and exams.

19:58.663 --> 20:01.029
When we worked, we have to do well.

20:01.053 --> 20:02.953
We don't have time for fun.

20:03.983 --> 20:05.263
Right.

20:08.333 --> 20:09.663
You know what?

20:09.663 --> 20:13.927
I always think of my grandma
when I see your grandma.

20:15.183 --> 20:17.419
Are they alike? How?

20:18.555 --> 20:20.213
The atmosphere.

20:21.743 --> 20:23.523
They have the same smell.

20:26.573 --> 20:28.773
My grandma died three years ago.

20:29.463 --> 20:31.807
I've never smelled it again.

20:34.663 --> 20:39.455
What does my granny smell like?

20:43.093 --> 20:45.223
She smells like baking bread.

20:45.223 --> 20:46.655
It's warm.

20:53.293 --> 20:54.653
Tell me about you.

20:54.841 --> 20:57.983
How did you think of
returning home to start a business?

20:57.983 --> 20:59.573
To make money.

20:59.573 --> 21:01.743
Living off the land.

21:01.743 --> 21:03.223
Strangers are coming to invest.

21:03.223 --> 21:05.987
I'm a local. I have every advantage.

21:06.223 --> 21:07.607
Right.

21:17.663 --> 21:19.013
Just a little contouring.

21:19.013 --> 21:21.453
Actually, boys are fine with makeup.

21:23.053 --> 21:24.623
Why are you so careless?

21:24.623 --> 21:25.853
It's okay.

21:25.853 --> 21:26.903
I'm sorry.

21:26.903 --> 21:28.093
I'll get you a new one.

21:28.093 --> 21:29.373
Okay.

21:36.293 --> 21:38.733
I'm sorry. I didn't mean to do it.

21:39.143 --> 21:40.423
It's okay.

22:14.333 --> 22:16.101
Thank you. I'm okay.

22:16.441 --> 22:18.641
It's from the girl at the desk.

22:18.773 --> 22:20.121
I've got it.

22:25.053 --> 22:26.519
Does your arm hurt?

22:26.773 --> 22:28.095
No.

22:29.413 --> 22:32.989
It doesn't hurt. You just can't lift it.

22:33.013 --> 22:36.447
You almost put a plate on his head.

22:37.298 --> 22:39.978
Now you know it's good to go to school.

22:43.253 --> 22:45.069
What's with the weather?

22:45.983 --> 22:47.655
There's no wind.

22:51.293 --> 22:52.573
Alright.

23:02.727 --> 23:05.573
Get your wages for this
week's work this weekend.

23:05.573 --> 23:06.873
Then go home.

23:07.383 --> 23:10.579
You're spoiled. You shouldn't be doing this.

23:10.703 --> 23:12.231
I won't go home.

23:12.670 --> 23:15.110
None of my family is looking for me.

23:18.270 --> 23:20.650
You're just spoiled by your family.

23:23.241 --> 23:25.323
Wish Yao was my brother.

23:26.903 --> 23:29.583
Fine. I'll give him to you.

23:30.223 --> 23:32.123
If only that were possible.

23:37.903 --> 23:39.183
What about you?

23:39.623 --> 23:43.011
Do you keep working like that?

23:46.841 --> 23:48.836
It's good.

23:49.383 --> 23:50.803
Nobody manages you.

23:51.703 --> 23:53.027
How to say?

23:53.470 --> 23:55.584
My parents got divorced when I was a kid.

23:55.584 --> 23:57.674
They had their own families.

23:57.698 --> 23:59.556
I lived with my grandpa.

24:00.727 --> 24:02.802
Then he passed away.

24:02.841 --> 24:04.683
I lived with my granny.

24:06.143 --> 24:08.343
She died this year.

24:09.184 --> 24:11.727
My mom called me to live with her.

24:12.493 --> 24:14.129
She's in Ruili.

24:14.670 --> 24:18.360
I went there and saw a family of four

24:18.384 --> 24:20.955
cram up in a small house of 60 square meters.

24:20.955 --> 24:23.527
Two sisters slept in a bunk bed.

24:23.527 --> 24:25.218
There's no room for me.

24:26.053 --> 24:27.869
So, I called my father.

24:29.584 --> 24:31.852
It's no longer in service.

24:37.223 --> 24:43.943
You don't know how great it is
to have your parents, your brother

24:43.943 --> 24:47.199
and your grandma to keep you in line.

25:10.813 --> 25:14.623
In fact, Youfeng Yard doesn't
take too much out of me.

25:14.623 --> 25:18.623
Now, I'm going between
the e-commerce warehouse and the cafe.

25:18.623 --> 25:21.771
I'm a little busy, but I can handle it.

25:22.333 --> 25:24.053
Don't try to be strong.

25:24.143 --> 25:25.903
There's so much to do in the warehouse.

25:25.903 --> 25:28.623
If you can't make it,
we can hire someone in the cafe.

25:28.623 --> 25:29.903
No need.

25:29.903 --> 25:31.333
Let's save some costs.

25:31.333 --> 25:32.943
Anyway, Xiaoyue is always there.

25:32.943 --> 25:36.493
If something comes up when
I'm out, just let Xiaoyue call me.

25:36.493 --> 25:38.053
I think it's all right.

25:38.053 --> 25:41.143
Everyone does their day job the normal way.

25:41.143 --> 25:43.093
But the relationships are a bit complicated.

25:43.093 --> 25:45.333
We always need the manager to mediate.

25:45.333 --> 25:46.969
The same old problem.

25:48.053 --> 25:50.183
Yeah, it's an old problem.

25:50.183 --> 25:51.493
They're all elders.

25:51.493 --> 25:52.294
They know me well.

25:52.294 --> 25:53.943
They have no sense of boundary.

25:53.943 --> 25:55.703
No one takes me as a manager.

25:55.703 --> 26:00.253
What's more, aunties and
grannies who have nothing to do

26:00.253 --> 26:03.623
often hang out here
and chat during working hours.

26:03.623 --> 26:07.183
Aunt E made two wrong packages in three days.

26:07.183 --> 26:10.213
If I directly manage them,
they can do well for a while.

26:10.213 --> 26:12.423
But they go back to the way
they were in a few days.

26:12.423 --> 26:15.703
Especially those grannies,
they're like kids in kindergarten.

26:15.703 --> 26:17.755
If I said too much, they'd get angry with me.

26:17.755 --> 26:20.085
The cafe got the same problem.

26:20.773 --> 26:24.639
There's such a problem
when you work with acquaintances.

26:24.663 --> 26:26.899
I'd just say, urge them.

26:27.773 --> 26:30.333
And ask them to be hard on themselves

26:30.333 --> 26:32.093
and be easy to manage in the work.

26:32.093 --> 26:35.943
Yao, I just think we two
are too familiar with them.

26:35.943 --> 26:37.493
There's a lot to take in.

26:37.493 --> 26:39.993
And there are many emotional factors.

26:46.943 --> 26:48.223
Xiaochun,

26:49.183 --> 26:54.789
what do you think if we hire
an outsider to manage them?

26:54.813 --> 26:56.423
Let's start with the cafe.

26:56.423 --> 26:58.955
Regulate it from point to whole.

26:58.955 --> 27:01.293
And increase awareness about the service.

27:01.293 --> 27:03.061
Good.

27:03.223 --> 27:05.298
That would be great for us.

27:05.298 --> 27:06.853
Do you have someone particular in mind?

27:06.853 --> 27:07.743
Of course.

27:07.743 --> 27:09.743
She's come to us. She's available.

27:09.743 --> 27:10.623
Who?

27:10.623 --> 27:13.119
Xu Hongdou. Manager Xu.

27:13.143 --> 27:16.093
She just resigned from the front line
of service of a five-star hotel.

27:16.093 --> 27:17.383
She can handle it well.

27:17.383 --> 27:19.183
Forget it.

27:19.183 --> 27:22.183
She quit and came here to get some rest.

27:22.183 --> 27:25.619
How can she wanna work with us?

27:26.703 --> 27:29.671
There are ways.

27:30.703 --> 27:35.223
From what I could tell,
Xu Hongdou is industrious and kind.

27:35.223 --> 27:38.789
And most importantly, she likes my granny.

27:38.813 --> 27:41.773
Taken together, these
weaknesses... No, wait.

27:41.773 --> 27:42.943
Weaknesses?

27:42.943 --> 27:44.784
Xie Zhiyao, what do you mean?

27:44.784 --> 27:48.293
Are you going to tell her about
you returning home to start a business?

27:48.293 --> 27:49.984
Moral kidnapping.

27:49.984 --> 27:53.659
Why do you make my business sound so bad?

27:54.903 --> 27:57.139
You're making it sound good.

27:57.983 --> 27:59.263
Yao.

28:00.383 --> 28:01.053
Uncle.

28:01.053 --> 28:02.253
Uncle.

28:02.253 --> 28:03.533
Master Xie.

28:43.853 --> 28:46.199
Uncle, have some tea.

28:46.223 --> 28:47.503
Okay.

28:47.983 --> 28:51.119
I guess this work would take you several months.

28:51.143 --> 28:52.293
Don't think too much.

28:52.293 --> 28:53.623
I didn't do that much.

28:53.623 --> 28:56.143
I just had a meal with President Li.

28:56.143 --> 28:57.943
Mainly because he likes it.

28:57.943 --> 29:00.287
It was a budget issue before.

29:00.493 --> 29:01.773
Yao.

29:02.943 --> 29:04.773
Let's sit and talk. Come on.

29:04.773 --> 29:06.073
Sit down, please.

29:12.183 --> 29:13.463
Yao.

29:13.463 --> 29:18.119
Well, I've told you before,

29:18.143 --> 29:21.960
there's nothing good on the Internet.

29:21.984 --> 29:23.623
Look, they spend all of their time online.

29:23.623 --> 29:25.433
What have they got?

29:25.573 --> 29:28.359
Someone has a good life.

29:28.383 --> 29:31.687
They bought luxury cars and houses.

29:31.943 --> 29:36.441
That one became famous easily.

29:36.441 --> 29:39.903
He made millions, tens of millions again!

29:39.983 --> 29:41.367
What's it?

29:42.183 --> 29:44.191
This is poison!

29:44.573 --> 29:46.785
It's too poisonous!

29:47.293 --> 29:49.853
Young people saw that all day long,

29:49.853 --> 29:53.423
can they concentrate on their work?

29:53.423 --> 29:54.623
They're all impatient.

29:54.623 --> 29:56.283
They do no decent work.

29:56.813 --> 29:58.213
In their eyes,

29:58.213 --> 30:01.143
a couple hundred,
a couple thousand is no longer money.

30:01.143 --> 30:05.539
They think about how to earn millions,
tens of millions all the time.

30:06.333 --> 30:07.613
Yeah.

30:08.773 --> 30:11.453
When you just came back,

30:11.703 --> 30:18.573
you told me you'd help me
with package and promotion.

30:18.573 --> 30:22.509
You'd make money with the woodcarvers.

30:22.533 --> 30:26.423
You said the government
wanted to revitalize the countrysides

30:26.423 --> 30:28.143
and develop tourism.

30:28.183 --> 30:31.703
You'd build the infrastructure
when you returned home.

30:31.703 --> 30:32.254
Right?

30:32.254 --> 30:34.574
You wanted to build your hometown.

30:35.383 --> 30:38.603
Let me be honest.
I'm not afraid of offending you.

30:38.903 --> 30:40.443
I didn't believe you.

30:42.841 --> 30:48.229
I think you've learned a lot of
bad things outside all these years.

30:48.253 --> 30:49.143
When you came back,

30:49.143 --> 30:54.319
you also wanted to find
an easy way to make millions, right?

30:57.293 --> 30:59.925
You're not the only one who said that.

31:00.663 --> 31:04.143
People doubt what they don't understand.

31:04.143 --> 31:05.423
It's normal.

31:09.423 --> 31:10.855
In the past,

31:11.493 --> 31:13.513
if you were a real craftsman,

31:13.623 --> 31:16.015
people would come to you.

31:18.183 --> 31:19.843
Now it's different.

31:23.813 --> 31:27.357
It was to meet the demand before.

31:27.423 --> 31:29.947
Now it's to create demand.

31:30.333 --> 31:34.897
My granny said the world was different.

31:37.773 --> 31:39.053
Yeah.

31:40.493 --> 31:42.513
Times have changed.

32:39.943 --> 32:41.759
It's right.

32:53.813 --> 32:54.813
Mom.

32:54.813 --> 32:58.463
Xiaochun, Xiaxia took his bank card.

32:58.463 --> 33:02.143
I told you before, you
should let him take it himself.

33:02.143 --> 33:05.253
I was afraid he'd play games and waste money.

33:05.253 --> 33:08.053
Look, how did he know where I put my key?

33:08.053 --> 33:11.069
Hulu knows. How could he not know?

33:11.293 --> 33:13.223
Alright. Just let him take it.

33:13.223 --> 33:15.463
Anyway, he needs money in Shanghai.

33:15.463 --> 33:17.703
He should have told me.

33:17.703 --> 33:19.143
It's not like I wouldn't give it to him.

33:19.143 --> 33:20.333
He didn't dare tell you.

33:20.333 --> 33:22.573
You're usually strict with him.

33:22.573 --> 33:24.545
Alright. It's okay.

33:27.013 --> 33:28.937
This old lady.

33:31.641 --> 33:32.921
[Xiaxia]

33:35.663 --> 33:36.943
Hello?

33:37.533 --> 33:38.853
Let me tell you.

33:38.853 --> 33:41.293
Mom knew you took the bank card.

33:41.293 --> 33:44.093
Well, I'll transfer 3,000 yuan to your WeChat.

33:44.093 --> 33:46.713
Try not to spend the money on the card.

33:47.743 --> 33:49.053
Do you hear me?

33:49.053 --> 33:49.624
Yeah.

33:49.624 --> 33:51.493
No need to do that. I brought money.

33:51.493 --> 33:54.013
Alright. Have fun over there.

33:54.013 --> 33:55.853
Got to go, I need to work.

33:58.053 --> 34:00.493
Aunt Baoping keeps Xiaxia's card?

34:02.503 --> 34:06.293
My mom asked him to transfer
2,000 yuan to the card every month.

34:06.293 --> 34:07.973
It's for him to get a wife.

34:07.973 --> 34:10.253
Not much, actually, it's 20,000 to 30,000 yuan.

34:10.253 --> 34:12.293
I think Xiaxia is usually frugal.

34:12.293 --> 34:13.870
When his white T-shirt got yellow,

34:13.870 --> 34:17.270
he dyed it in a tie-dye workshop
and kept wearing it.

34:17.773 --> 34:20.223
Did he steal the card to buy stocks?

34:20.223 --> 34:21.893
The stock market has been booming lately.

34:21.893 --> 34:24.893
The overall market is going up,
which became a hashtag several times.

34:24.893 --> 34:26.663
He won't.

34:26.663 --> 34:30.223
Girls like you who are from
a good family are different from us.

34:30.223 --> 34:32.853
Xiaxia and I were poor since we were kids.

34:32.853 --> 34:34.333
We know it's hard to make money.

34:34.333 --> 34:36.973
We hold on to the money we have.

34:36.973 --> 34:39.953
We wouldn't touch what we don't know.

34:40.543 --> 34:41.703
That's good.

34:41.703 --> 34:43.583
He asked me about it the other day.

34:43.583 --> 34:45.853
I told him never to touch stocks.

34:45.853 --> 34:47.537
It's way too risky.

35:01.253 --> 35:03.373
Young man, how can I help you?

35:03.373 --> 35:05.584
- I want to report a crime.
- What's it?

35:05.584 --> 35:07.373
I've been cheated out of money.

35:07.373 --> 35:09.253
You sent money to an online friend by an ATM?

35:09.253 --> 35:11.933
Not an ATM. It's a fund website.

35:11.933 --> 35:13.223
Someone referred it to me.

35:13.223 --> 35:16.183
No problem with registering and adding money.

35:16.183 --> 35:17.843
Then I couldn't log in.

35:17.893 --> 35:22.293
And then that man left
an address for me in Shanghai.

35:22.293 --> 35:24.098
I sent something to this address.

35:24.098 --> 35:26.973
When I reported the case there,
they told me to go where it happened.

35:26.973 --> 35:28.513
So, I rushed back.

35:29.183 --> 35:31.773
Young man, you've got a clear mind.

35:31.773 --> 35:33.973
How did you fall for this pig-butchering scam?

35:33.973 --> 35:35.253
Pig-butchering?

35:35.413 --> 35:36.413
It's okay.

35:36.413 --> 35:38.583
Come over here and take a statement.

35:38.583 --> 35:39.863
Okay.

35:43.503 --> 35:48.823
They all asked me how Yuan's mom treated you.

35:48.898 --> 35:50.624
Why did they ask?

35:51.527 --> 35:54.213
They said you didn't care about Yuan.

35:54.213 --> 35:57.063
It must be because your
stepmother used to treat you badly.

35:57.063 --> 35:58.517
She hit you.

36:00.103 --> 36:02.111
When did aunt ever hit me?

36:02.143 --> 36:03.479
Only you hit me.

36:04.543 --> 36:07.367
When did I hit you?

36:07.453 --> 36:09.241
Fine, you didn't do that.

36:09.241 --> 36:11.681
You were wielding the stick of love.

36:13.373 --> 36:14.813
What did you say to them?

36:14.813 --> 36:18.663
I told them Yao knew what he was doing.

36:18.663 --> 36:20.429
Yuan didn't get lost.

36:20.453 --> 36:23.661
However, they didn't believe me.

36:24.063 --> 36:25.543
Whatever.

36:28.183 --> 36:29.463
Yao.

36:30.498 --> 36:31.743
Tell me.

36:31.743 --> 36:35.083
I won't tell anyone. Okay?

36:41.973 --> 36:43.357
Excuse me.

36:47.143 --> 36:48.373
Hello? Xiaxia.

36:48.373 --> 36:49.653
What's up?

37:01.893 --> 37:03.173
Okay.

37:03.755 --> 37:06.015
I'll come from home. Wait for me.

37:14.773 --> 37:16.073
Xu Hongdou.

37:17.583 --> 37:18.863
Xu Hongdou.

37:19.583 --> 37:20.414
What are you doing?

37:20.414 --> 37:22.841
There are two birdhouses over here.

37:22.841 --> 37:25.109
Want me to get them for you?

37:28.613 --> 37:30.498
You don't go for a run today?

37:30.498 --> 37:32.404
I want to do nothing.

37:32.955 --> 37:35.189
What about going to town?

37:35.241 --> 37:37.719
I won't go to artificial attractions.

37:37.743 --> 37:39.023
Fine.

38:03.470 --> 38:06.623
Granny, I'm going to the old town later.

38:06.623 --> 38:09.223
I'll ask Xu Hongdou to take you to sell things.

38:09.223 --> 38:12.335
No need, I can do it myself.

38:15.773 --> 38:17.853
No. What are you thinking?

38:17.853 --> 38:20.429
By the way, do me a favor later.

38:20.453 --> 38:22.557
What do you need me for?

38:22.955 --> 38:26.917
Tell her about me returning
home to start a business.

38:28.703 --> 38:30.293
You want to keep her?

38:30.293 --> 38:33.645
No. I want her to do me a favor.

38:35.223 --> 38:39.623
Well, should I make it sound miserable or good?

38:39.623 --> 38:42.051
Make it sound difficult.

38:44.373 --> 38:44.894
Fine.

38:44.894 --> 38:46.103
You eat, I'll go now.

38:46.103 --> 38:47.253
Do the dishes yourself.

38:47.253 --> 38:48.533
Okay.

38:58.623 --> 39:00.379
What are you doing?

39:02.293 --> 39:04.103
Where's the smell of baking bread?

39:04.103 --> 39:05.643
Why can't I smell it?

39:08.333 --> 39:09.813
You're like a dog.

39:17.293 --> 39:22.289
Hongdou, do you have a boyfriend?

39:22.973 --> 39:24.261
No.

39:24.853 --> 39:27.053
Why don't you have one yet?

39:28.253 --> 39:30.098
I haven't met the one I like.

39:30.098 --> 39:32.641
Just the one you like?

39:32.933 --> 39:34.989
Yeah, just the one I like.

39:35.853 --> 39:39.013
What if his family is poor?

39:40.023 --> 39:41.971
It's okay.

39:42.333 --> 39:43.813
I can make money.

40:02.041 --> 40:05.063
♫ Stars in the sky ♫

40:05.063 --> 40:07.923
♫ I pick some mushrooms ♫

40:07.923 --> 40:10.833
♫ Mushrooms can fill the basket ♫

40:10.833 --> 40:13.693
♫ I take out a pen ♫

40:13.693 --> 40:16.323
♫ The pen leaks ink ♫

40:16.323 --> 40:19.233
♫ What can I do ♫

40:19.233 --> 40:23.843
♫ I have piles of mung beans ♫

40:27.470 --> 40:30.493
♫ Mung beans are delicious ♫

40:30.493 --> 40:33.353
♫ Gingers are tender ♫

40:33.353 --> 40:35.813
♫ Tender gingers taste pungent ♫

40:35.813 --> 40:38.955
♫ They pile up like a tower ♫

40:38.955 --> 40:41.657
Okay, let's go.

40:43.223 --> 40:44.503
Go.

40:44.727 --> 40:49.190
♫ My baby, let's go to sleep ♫

40:49.870 --> 40:56.595
♫ My baby, let's go to sleep ♫

41:04.583 --> 41:07.167
It's 1.25 jin. Let me figure it out.

41:12.503 --> 41:14.623
It's 68.75 yuan.

41:14.623 --> 41:16.103
I'll charge you 68 yuan.

41:16.103 --> 41:17.383
Okay.

41:21.853 --> 41:23.133
Thank you.

41:24.333 --> 41:25.613
Thank you.

41:34.063 --> 41:34.854
Mom, stop it.

41:34.854 --> 41:37.103
I can't carry so much stuff to take a plane.

41:37.103 --> 41:38.623
Come on.

41:38.623 --> 41:40.293
They provide you with room and board.

41:40.293 --> 41:43.273
It's polite of you to get something for them.

41:43.773 --> 41:45.413
You don't like them.

41:45.413 --> 41:48.583
Look, if mom sells these milk fans,
it'd cost over 50 yuan per jin.

41:48.583 --> 41:50.603
Figure out how much they are.

41:52.253 --> 41:53.673
Go wash the dishes.

41:56.023 --> 41:57.023
He's leaving soon.

41:57.023 --> 41:59.063
You still ask him to do the dishes.

41:59.063 --> 41:59.773
Really!

41:59.773 --> 42:03.173
He's never been out.
You're not worried about him?

42:03.373 --> 42:06.503
Come on. He's too big.

42:06.503 --> 42:08.543
Don't turn him into a mama's boy. Okay?

42:08.543 --> 42:09.743
What mama's boy?

42:09.743 --> 42:13.383
He'll be a mama's boy
if you keep spoiling him like this.

42:13.703 --> 42:15.333
How did I spoil him?

42:15.333 --> 42:18.133
He got beaten up a lot when he was little.

42:18.583 --> 42:20.483
I'm not your Aunt Feng.

42:23.023 --> 42:24.971
There's no room left, mom.

42:30.555 --> 42:32.155
Do you want milk fans?

42:35.933 --> 42:37.213
Yao.

42:38.223 --> 42:39.703
Good for you.

42:39.870 --> 42:41.906
You're selling things here.

42:43.413 --> 42:45.470
Where did you get the scale?

42:45.470 --> 42:47.230
I paid 20 yuan for it.

42:51.143 --> 42:53.861
Go. Let's eat something.

43:00.213 --> 43:06.721
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

43:07.653 --> 43:13.537
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

43:15.063 --> 43:21.433
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

43:21.433 --> 43:27.833
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

43:29.773 --> 43:36.185
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

43:37.143 --> 43:42.919
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

43:44.573 --> 43:51.103
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

43:51.103 --> 43:58.475
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

43:59.383 --> 44:05.823
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

44:05.823 --> 44:13.823
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

44:13.953 --> 44:16.003
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

44:16.003 --> 44:20.633
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

44:20.633 --> 44:28.973
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

44:32.643 --> 44:38.779
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

44:39.973 --> 44:46.349
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

44:47.363 --> 44:53.783
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

44:53.783 --> 45:01.783
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

45:02.143 --> 45:08.593
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

45:08.593 --> 45:16.597
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

45:16.803 --> 45:18.783
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

45:18.783 --> 45:23.383
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

45:23.383 --> 45:30.743
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

45:30.743 --> 45:38.759
♫ Go to a windy place to meet you ♫
